  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given a matrix AAA of integers. Your task is to write a program to calculate and print the sum of each row and each column of the matrix.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of the input contains two integers, MMM and NNN, representing the number of rows and columns in the matrix, respectively.\nThe next MMM lines contain NNN integers each, representing the elements of the matrix.\n\n\nOutput Format\n\nOn the first line, print the sum of each row, separated by spaces.\nOn the second line, print the sum of each column, separated by spaces.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤N,M≤2001 \\leq N, M \\leq 2001≤N,M≤200",
      "1≤Aij≤5001 \\leq A_{ij} \\leq 5001≤Aij​≤500"
    ],
